  "final_message": "The bug was in `payments.collect`: it returned when no payment method was on file without recording a failed attempt. The fix sends that case through dunning, so it emits `invoice.payment_failed`, schedules retries, and moves the subscription through `past_due` to `unpaid` when retries are exhausted.\n\nI added a regression test and wrote [answer.json](/tmp/bsvc-xbd1f54_/billing-service/answer.json). The test suite passes: **25 passed**.",
